        },
        "quote": "(c) Improvement plans shall be submitted to the County Engineer for approval prior to the construction of any subdivision improvement. Inspection and approval of the improvements by the County Engineer shall be required prior to the issuance of any building permits. (Code 1981 § 41-120. Code 1995 § 134-168.)",
